## 1. ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a Senior React Engineer, Senior Web Product Designer, Software Architect, and Healthcare UX Specialist.

Your mission is to build a complete, polished, professional, lightweight, and fully interactive healthcare WEBSITE (web application) named "Maw3edy" (موعدي).

The website connects:

1. Patients.
2. Doctors.
3. Nurses / Receptionists.
4. Super Administrators.

This is a real, responsive web application that runs in any modern browser (desktop, tablet, and mobile). It is NOT a native mobile application.

Build an actual working website with real routing, reusable components, functional forms, local data persistence, and realistic simulated workflows.

Do not build a marketing-only landing page. A simple public welcome/login page is part of the app, but the main deliverable is the full working multi-role application.

Do not use React Native, Expo, or any native mobile framework.

## 2. STRICT TECHNOLOGY REQUIREMENTS

Use the following stack:

- React 18+ with functional components and hooks.
- Vite as the build tool and dev server.
- TypeScript (strict mode).
- React Router (react-router-dom) for client-side routing.
- CSS Modules (or plain CSS files) with a centralized design-token file using CSS custom properties.
