- localStorage for demo data persistence (wrapped in a reusable storage service; use IndexedDB only if data size requires it).
- lucide-react for icons.
- A locally bundled Arabic font (Cairo or Noto Sans Arabic via @fontsource) so there is no runtime network dependency.

Install dependencies with npm using standard, current compatible versions. Do not guess versions; let npm resolve them.

IMPORTANT:

This project must remain a genuine web project.

Do NOT use:

- React Native.
- Expo or Expo Router.
- AsyncStorage.
- lucide-react-native.
- StyleSheet.create.
- Native-only components (View, Text, FlatList, Pressable, SafeAreaView, KeyboardAvoidingView).
